==Battleground==
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 31.67 seconds<sup>950f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gabriel]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A simple way to beat this stage is to stack up long range attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cat]], ([[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]]) [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], etc. Don't forget to protect them properly with meatshields or with [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]]. Artist Cat is especially important here, as he can make almost any army work as long as he has a decent level.

